 "_note": "R45 town quest boards, multi-stop quest lines and phase bands. Boards: discovered towns only; `show` jobs, new set every `rotateDays`. `fromBand` jobs come from your band (phase), the rest from the band above (stretch). Rewards: coin × band mult; town favour as listed. Job kinds use existing mechanics: deliver (goods handed over at the town; get them made with Work Orders), clear (a fight near the town: needs the CP), escort (a cart to another town). DLC towns add a pool here. autoBar: Auto-Adventure takes a band job only when its coin per trip-day (minus the goods' value) is at least autoBar × the coin per trip-day of the repeat quest it would otherwise run (quests also give loot, XP and renown). Each finished job also gives renown = its band and some XP (fights: the member's best combat skill).",
